&lt;p&gt;RAWALPINDI: The body of a lawyer was found inside a car at the Judicial Complex’s parking lot on Wednesday, police said.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;According to the initial police report, a moharir at the judicial complex informed Civil Lines police about the body at around 9:30am.&lt;/p&gt;
